## Third-party notices

This repository contains one third-party test fixture:

* `test/fixtures/ascend-trace_view.sample.json` — a truncated prefix of
  `profiler/msprof_analyze/test/ut/advisor/advisor_backend/timeline_advice/trace_view.json`
  from the **Ascend/mstt** project (<https://github.com/Ascend/mstt>), which is
  licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It is used unmodified apart from being
  cut off mid-event (which is deliberate: it exercises the parser's tolerance
  for an export interrupted before the closing bracket). See
  `test/fixtures/README.md` for details.

No third-party runtime code is bundled or vendored: the plugin and its page use
only Node.js built-ins and browser-native APIs.
